We are about to enter an Ice Age. Time is short. The continent and the Tree of Life are at risk.
Glacies finished her training with Raory and asked for help from Branwen and Herfies, the Lady of Autumn. Suvien, the Lady of Summer, stays with the Tree of Life to keep it warm.
The fairies joined the Elemental Priestesses in Gallubia Valley. With the Quintessence, we will destroy the glacial river.

Take the Quintessence to Gallubia Valley.

[Challenge Objective]

Activate the Quintessence in Snowstorm Valley, in Gallubia Valley, in the marked area, and defeat the Snow Lady.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
